      "message": "shipping resolves Product.estimate with @requires(fields: \"weight\"), and Product.estimate does not carry @authenticated on Product.weight; the router checks the client's operation, not the fields it fetches for a @requires, so a request allowed Product.estimate is answered from fields it may not read, and composition (Federation 2.9 and later) refuses the supergraph for it",
